      "created_at": "2025-12-23T03:19:49.537Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/asieftejani\">@asieftejani</a> this is bit embarassing but in an attempt to make the cleanest screenshot I could for you, I think I solved it <img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/sweat_smile.png?v=14\" title=\":sweat_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":sweat_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>I disabled as much as possible to make sure ONLY Projects was accessible. Turns out it was likely the <em>Roles</em> that were still enabling some of these modules.</p>\n<p>Clearly, I still have a lot to learn.</p>\n<p>I appreciate you attempting to help a stranger!</p>",
